+# Stage 3 — Dashboard visual pass
+
+This stage focuses on the upper half of the dashboard without changing the already established architecture.
+
+## Updated
+- HeaderAnalytick: premium typography, richer card treatment, proper period dropdown for reviews.
+- ReviewsChart: interactive SVG chart, keyboard navigation, tooltips, period switching, legend and two series.
+- TasksChart: interactive bars, period switching, project tooltips, completion/overdue summaries.
+- PeriodMenu: reusable lightweight period selector for dashboard widgets.
+- Typography: Manrope is used for display/metric values while Onest remains the UI text face.
+
+## PIN
+Keyboard/NumPad PIN input was already implemented in Stage 2 and remains unchanged.
